; SETCANVASSIZE/CANVASSIZE: a resizable canvas (Terrapin's SETEXTENT/
; EXTENT, renamed for clarity). The actual widget resize is GTK, in
; ui.c, so this example only shows the visible effect when run from
; the actual app, not the headless test driver -- but the state changes
; (canvas size, turtle re-homing) happen the same way either way.

PRINT CANVASSIZE   ; the default: 500 500

SETCANVASSIZE 800 400   ; wider, shorter -- same reset as CLEAR/CS: the
                        ; old drawing doesn't fit a different size, so
                        ; lines/fills are cleared and every turtle goes
                        ; back to the new center

PRINT CANVASSIZE   ; 800 400
PRINT POS          ; 400 200 -- the new center

REPEAT 4 [FD 150 RT 90]   ; a square, sized and centered for the new canvas

SETCANVASSIZE 10 10   ; too small (must be 50-4000) -- reports an error
                      ; and leaves the 800x400 canvas untouched
